        fn(0x0006a610L, "RenderState_SetValue", "Render-state cache (Milestone 60, inferred from the code). Sets one cached render state (slot in EDI, a 20-byte entry in the renderer at +0x64 + 0x14*i; cache in EBX = renderer+8; new value via the stack pointer). Does nothing if the value is unchanged; otherwise saves the old value as an undo record (vtable 0x3A3890) on the current scope and queues the slot for RenderState_Flush. 638 call sites, e.g. Render_SetStartupStates sets D3DFILL_SOLID (0x1B02) and D3DSHADE_GOURAUD (0x1D01) this way.");
